  "description": "Lee San has lived as a ronin for ten years in the jungles of Nanman and the vast desert of Dunhuang. Now, armed with the Nine Moon Reflection talent and a sword, he set foot on the path of revenge against Kangho. Become an unparalleled hero and make great achievements, drenched in Kangho’s blood. This is the epic tale of the wandering ronin, Lee San.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55946961), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13228449)",
